# The BASE facts are the corpus, restated. They are the records of E3M1.MAP
# verbatim, they are 2.1 MB, and they are byte-reproducible from the map:
#
#   PYTHONPATH=".;projects/e3m1-decompiled/source" \
#       python projects/e3m1-decompiled/source/build_facts.py
#
# The project's standing rule is that the corpus is never committed and the
# command that regenerates it is (provenance.json). The DERIVED facts -- what
# the readers found, with their provenance -- are the deliverable and are
# committed.
sector.jsonl
wall.jsonl
sprite.jsonl
xsector.jsonl
xwall.jsonl
xsprite.jsonl
connects.jsonl
